Maintainer: Alexander M. Sandercock <aherranssanderco@ufl.edu>
Description: This R Shiny application provides a point-and-click interface for the Breeding Insight HapApp_utils pipeline.
    This application enables users to 1) process raw Missing Allele Discovery Counts (MADC) files to assign fixed allele IDs
    and filter for quality, 2) Update the microhaplotype database with newly discovered unique microhaplotypes, and 3) Generate
    the intital v1 database for tracking of unique alleles across sequencing runs.
